flowchart LR
    Tmux[tmux status refresh] --> Cache{Fresh cached weather?}
    Cache -->|yes| Pill[Show weather pill]
    Cache -->|no| Wttr[Request wttr.in]
    Wttr -->|empty or invalid| OpenMeteo[Try Open-Meteo]
    Wttr -->|valid| Save[Save recognized line]
    OpenMeteo --> Save
    Save --> Pill
    Cache -->|no cache and both fail| Last[Keep last good value]
